<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $135 mln in repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $135 mln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Monday it placed $135 million in overnight repurchase agreements at nine percent against government bonds.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, overnight call money rose to 6.95 percent from 6.83 percent Friday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar rose to 0.99983 pesos from 0.99933 pesos at the close Friday.</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0668</p>
</text>
